      players: '2, 3, 4, or 6 players. Four or six players form teams of two sharing a tableau.',
      deck: 'Dedicated Mille Bornes deck of 106 cards: 18 hazards, 38 remedies, 4 safeties, 46 distance cards (25, 50, 75, 100, 200 km).',
      equipment: 'Mille Bornes card game (commercial deck).',
      dealing: 'Shuffle and deal six cards to each player. Remainder forms the draw pile; a discard pile forms next to it. Each turn: draw one card from stock, then play one card to tableau or discard one. Hand size stays at six after play.',
