      'Opening flow: start in play; each_player_clockwise may use draw, play_card, discard before round end.',
      'Scoring check: Points per hand: 1 per km traveled; 100 per safety; 300 bonus for all four safeties; 300 per coup-fourré; 400 for completing the trip; 300 delayed action (trip after stock exhausted); 300 safe trip (no 200 km cards); 200 extension bonus; 500 shutout (opponent played no distance). Game ends when one side reaches 5000 points; if both exceed 5000 in the same hand, higher total wins. Expected outcome: 5000.',
